<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-22T07:48:32.124Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:48:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Kenyan-led forces and Erik Prince's contractors are now using drones and air support to strike gang positions in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff, while Sri Lankan police, army and a Bangladesh UN advance team have been deployed to Haiti. The United Nations has renewed sanctions on Haiti and allocated US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. Four soldiers from the UN-backed force and five Salvadoran soldiers remain missing after a gang ambush, showing continued threats to foreign troops. President Bukele has threatened Haitian gangs over the abduction of Salvadoran soldiers and launched a military operation to rescue them. The conflict caused 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/el-salvadors-bukele-threatens-haitian-gangs-over-abducted-soldiers?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/el-salvador-launches-military-operation-in-haiti-to-free-four-kidnapped-aviation-technicia&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPaFlEUDZDeTkwaUxqVFFsUHZvQkJDd3U3R2NqZDY0bmE1ZDg1dE9EVUgzV3g5ZHlkcWs2UXRETmxERkd5dEZxM0ZoWk5JUWJJNGZmNUlNcUNTbllpdW1jS1RFVDdYVk4xajNuTUtZaWFLNUZzeWdFNVdpeVFkdHplZGxFVkJvNUZmR2JqS3NHeTFGQmI3aUlONmVITVJURG4yODdRMUVndzAzUlI0N1ljVFNidWN5SzEwd0RERGdkQXJBLWlh?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/21/world/americas/el-salvador-military-haiti-gangs.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPWXFZb1FxUlowcWMwdURfWXIyRlQ0Q09mOWltdHd1bVR5V2I4Mlg4LTNKbmNCQ2RURk90MjMwVXlSRFYxZVJ0ZEJMN0JMRlNiNS1qOEZITmtNRjdkU204QUtEV2ZkVlEzdUR5T2pHSENXcjFzN0pkelBfRV9DZXE1RU9waFlRVVJLYXcwcnNnZ1RFelNwSW83ZVBLRE9Yb